+# ("use_fp4_indexer_cache requires Blackwell datacenter GPUs (sm_10x ...);
+# sm_120 (consumer Blackwell) and earlier architectures are not supported"),
+# and attention_config.use_fp4_indexer_cache defaults to False. On Ada (sm_89)
+# the MXFP4 kernel's PTX is rejected outright by ptxas (--gpu-name=sm_89 exits
